<fragment mode="section" requested-start="doxcnzMiPZIvFsTOome91rsUPJg"><h2 id="doxcnzMiPZIvFsTOome91rsUPJg" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.9">个人中心与客服</h2><p id="doxcnOI6DMj3JQCYTAmZp3JDdSf">对应 PRD 3.1.8、3.2.4。</p><h3 id="doxcnpSyERGNUXYSuRKruZVxkIc" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.9.1">前端页面</h3><grid id="doxcn9QqmqqqfysiJaiZwhXpewc"><column id="doxcnyZA2570UafvslEjCmb15ce" width-ratio="0.500000"><p id="doxcnIRrBfU2Zf7eBskN0sS6NSf"><b>页面组成：</b>个人中心提供积分余额和今日签到摘要，以及积分商城、我的兑换券、积分明细、邀请好友、我的设计、购物车、我的订单、收货地址和客服微信入口。</p><p id="doxcn37MhqVhnXXwpPJCw3fkPCe">积分、兑换券和邀请入口都位于底部 Tab“我的”的二级页面，不新增底部 Tab；个人中心只返回摘要，完整流水、兑换券和邀请记录由对应接口分页读取。</p></column><column id="doxcnvoEwxHZBNQAQxmEq7oumnd" width-ratio="0.500000"><img id="doxcnHFDLiuS5nEht7XD5xVaOSf" name="test.jpg" caption="PRD：个人中心入口&#xA;" mime="image/jpeg" scale="0.388888" src="K9kfbbOqpo21e4xtbgGcEFBOn7O"/></column></grid><h3 id="doxcnDMoof3iLIuSW8h1BF16tPd" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.9.2">个人中心数据读取流程</h3><whiteboard id="doxcnMeIDBlExJG4VAAsZ51trDb" token="NnOow7IenhOoCybKvgacZn8ZnUd" type="mermaid">sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户小程序
    participant B as 业务普通云函数
    participant D as CloudBase MySQL
    U-&gt;&gt;B: 打开个人中心
    B-&gt;&gt;D: 查询本人有效 designs、cart_items、orders 摘要
    B-&gt;&gt;D: 读取公开 customer_service 配置
    B--&gt;&gt;U: 本人摘要和客服微信
    U-&gt;&gt;U: 点击入口进入对应业务页面</whiteboard><h3 id="doxcnBJj6SGJQqNF4GmW4GaQT1P" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.9.3">后端接口设计</h3><h4 id="doxcnCggpvasGv7tcdXvUPu7cWg" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.9.3.1">getProfileSummary</h4><p id="doxcnacDnrHzGo6dmsOxKOBQh9g"><b>代码映射</b></p><table id="doxcngasCn8VRfgOx7OEEPqbzGh"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn7OKgMqtUwVdUQQokSL5dId">action</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn2MxcDjRPoz1OVr5AT39cih">Handler</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnsXMvkQyztsMkq7Rf4NY8dh">Service 方法</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnmaU1CbPFVyxSD36rDS4r7e">事务</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnRef6uFhyluHhilVxtwjzCb">DAO</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnp0sYMX8y92wqtEHMaCTsuf">getProfileSummary</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnzrxMfnTNe1qwjBvyCk45Xe">GetProfileSummaryHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnsMFG1kHpRVOXlngrh3Z9bc">ProfileService.getProfileSummary()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnZw9b7xPpXHNWMbYpZYqF1c">条件性：首次建积分账户</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnHm608cZThcj82yUf8RxOuf">DesignDAO、CartDAO、OrderDAO、SiteConfigDAO、PointsAccountDAO、PointsLedgerDAO、SkuCouponDAO</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table id="doxcnhmrDNfhmBBqSjr2OrOTzmP"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnjOBq4xMV2wt07mJPBSBp4f">云函数与 action</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnlGWyL8tyHgNwuRpI69oGyZ">调用方与身份</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnpDpl5jX1kDNTz5WATfZnlY">用途</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn6RT6zZtISrSlS0XEYuk8YJ">business-api / getProfileSummary</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnzKdIWg0YfEaUtoWMdmBfQe">用户小程序；可信 OpenID</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcns6ynh2KAVlAYDHczXIk41d">一次返回个人中心入口所需的计数、最近订单摘要和公开客服信息。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcnCz6EZhIDiiOkxKgFLRvIqF"><b>请求 JSON</b></p><pre id="doxcnHs66hvK10rr9aj1CD02VUc" caption="&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "getProfileSummary",<br/>  "payload": {}<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnzhDINbWTBQvS9HlXJu2tLb"><b>响应 JSON</b></p><pre id="doxcnrG29V6sle9dVvcGzkbT3eg" caption="响应&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "design_count": 3,<br/>    "cart_item_count": 2,<br/>    "order_counts": {<br/>      "PENDING_PAYMENT": 1,<br/>      "READY_TO_SHIP": 0,<br/>      "SHIPPED": 1,<br/>      "COMPLETED": 2,<br/>      "CLOSED": 0<br/>    },<br/>    "points": {<br/>      "balance": 120,<br/>      "checked_in_today": false,<br/>      "invite_code": "A7K2",<br/>      "recent_ledger": [<br/>        {<br/>          "points_delta": 5,<br/>          "source_type": "DAILY_CHECK_IN",<br/>          "description": "每日签到",<br/>          "created_at": "2026-10-08T09:00:00+08:00"<br/>        }<br/>      ]<br/>    },<br/>    "sku_coupons": {<br/>      "available_count": 3,<br/>      "locked_count": 0<br/>    },<br/>    "recent_order": {<br/>      "order_no": "O202610080001",<br/>      "status": "SHIPPED",<br/>      "total_amount_cent": 32950,<br/>      "created_at": "2026-10-08T15:15:00+08:00"<br/>    },<br/>    "customer_service": {<br/>      "wechat_id": "公开客服微信号",<br/>      "qr_file_id": "cloud://service/qr.png"<br/>    }<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnH5bVHGt6yvC2m23dcTsq2f"><b>后端处理步骤</b></p><ol><li id="doxcnoA4i8LIE5hCZf9vvNJK1Lg" seq="1" seq-marker="1. ">GetProfileSummaryHandler 从可信上下文取得 OpenID，校验空 payload 后调用 ProfileService.getProfileSummary()；payload 不接受 OpenID。</li><li id="doxcnRbwD2N9GEUTSEy6uihUY4M" seq-marker="2. ">分别统计 designs 和 cart_items 中 _openid=当前 OpenID、is_deleted=0 的记录。</li><li id="doxcn9f9QvpN6YF9SNB6P9uYX7e" seq-marker="3. ">按 orders.status 聚合本人未删除订单数量，并读取最近一笔订单摘要。</li><li id="doxcnibwEMsX31uhUANN16mN3ec" seq-marker="4. ">读取 site_config.config_key='customer_service' AND is_deleted=0，只保留允许公开的字段。</li><li id="doxcnC4qjGLoJdvxTYdn2EcwIkf" seq-marker="5. ">不在个人中心接口返回完整订单、地址、手机号或设计 components；用户点击入口后调用对应详情接口。</li><li id="doxcnMWZo8ATV2WOMfbfPcv24se" seq="6" seq-marker="6. ">ProfileService 在 UnitOfWork 中调用 PointsService.ensureAccount()；没有账户时立即创建余额为 0、邀请码非空的 points_accounts，再读取签到状态和最近积分流水。</li><li id="doxcn8Vj5xkB1F17mTx54qIALxc" seq="7" seq-marker="7. ">统计本人 user_sku_coupons 中 AVAILABLE 和 LOCKED 数量，并返回 points_accounts.invite_code；个人中心不返回完整积分流水、兑换券明细或邀请关系。</li></ol><p id="doxcnqhWaEoY6lJfDp2MJPPhTKh"><b>数据库读取</b></p><table id="doxcnYNPj7ot0bamRH4NuMDNWxf"><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn0brU6XaYhiw1HbzsP9Vwdc">数据表</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnrAKW9ZKbObm8leUfG8svpg">条件与用途</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnlSeeay0d99BeE7xfoi1CFI">designs</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnxiC26Gog6Hv7aac2Dl1Rnb">本人未删除设计计数。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnJyjg3UDsoOPFVYLvSBN40d">cart_items</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn22MZOUzik9xcpSsDhoFIUg">本人未删除购物车条目计数。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnS37vwNPGLOYIo3zpkuPQye">orders</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnhplWXtK7755wIPXwNN3FWc">本人订单状态聚合和最近订单。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnC8JYNfhmJNRyhu8F1sq0nl">points_accounts、points_ledger</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnYgi2ulmb4bOT0a6MIEGCMe">积分余额、邀请码、今日签到状态和最近流水摘要。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnM9xkT3whhwQF3myXSuqQ2f">user_sku_coupons</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnGvfdrCNTRy70OiGhwNewEb">本人 AVAILABLE 与 LOCKED 兑换券数量。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnEzqeyc5hJdHLQi7IpkDuVb">site_config</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnZMnEVmJmo3PIfDI2OoPype">customer_service 公开配置。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcnxZ9rpczBlwmMyliWsCFXcg"><b>错误码：</b>没有有效小程序身份时返回 UNAUTHORIZED；客服配置缺失不视为整页失败，customer_service 返回 null。</p></fragment>
